.TH MINNID 1 "October 2026" "minni" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
minnid \- X11 clipboard history daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B minnid
.RI [ --config " path" ]
.RI [ --state-dir " path" ]
.RI [ --cache-dir " path" ]
.RI [ --socket " path" ]
.RI [ --no-x11 ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
minnid captures X11 clipboard changes, stores bounded history, and serves local
clients over a private Unix socket. It runs in the foreground for supervision.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --config " path"
Load configuration from path. The default is $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/minni/config.
.TP
.BI --state-dir " path"
Override durable storage location.
.TP
.BI --cache-dir " path"
Override the disposable image-preview cache directory.
.TP
.BI --socket " path"
Override the private IPC socket path.
.TP
.B --no-x11
Run storage and IPC without the X11 backend.
.TP
.B --help
Show command help.
.SH FILES
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/minni/config
.br
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/minni/
.br
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/minni/
.br
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/minni/minni.sock
.SH LIMITATIONS
Wayland is not supported. Run one clipboard manager at a time.
